# Code Style & Structure

Keep code simple and readable. Prefer small, focused widgets.

Use this folder layout:

```
lib/
  core/
  models/
  providers/
  services/
  screens/
  widgets/
```

- Put shared constants, theme, and helpers in `lib/core/`
- Put Riverpod providers in `lib/providers/`
- Put RevenueCat, storage, and notification logic in `lib/services/`
- Screens compose widgets; widgets stay small and reusable

```dart
// ✅ GOOD — small widget, loading/error handled at the call site
class RestorePurchaseButton extends ConsumerWidget { ... }

// ❌ BAD — giant screen with purchase, storage, and UI mixed together
```
